# Vulnerabilities accepted after review: each one with the reason and an expiry date.
# After the expiry date Trivy reports it again, so the exception has to be reviewed.

# apt and libapt-pkg7.0 3.0.3 (from the python:3.12 slim-trixie base image), fixed in 3.0.4.
